---
import { SITE } from '../lib/constants';
---
<section id="hakkinda" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-slate-50/50 pt-12 pb-24 sm:pt-20 sm:pb-32">
  <!-- Dynamic Background Orbs -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 -translate-y-12 translate-x-1/3 w-[800px] h-[800px] rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-100/60 to-brand-300/20 blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 translate-y-1/3 -translate-x-1/3 w-[600px] h-[600px] rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-accent-200/30 to-brand-100/20 blur-3xl opacity-60 pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="container-x relative grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 sm:gap-10 items-center z-10">
    <!-- Left: Content -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-6 max-w-2xl pt-4 sm:pt-0">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-brand-200/60 bg-white/60 px-3 py-1.5 sm:px-3.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-brand-700 backdrop-blur-md animate-fade-up shadow-sm">
        <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2">
          <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-brand-400 opacity-75"></span>
          <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-brand-500"></span>
        </span>
        <span class="truncate">Konya • Birebir Özel Ders & Danışmanlık</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="mt-5 sm:mt-6 text-[22px] min-[375px]:text-[26px] min-[400px]:text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-[2rem] xl:text-[2.5rem] font-display font-bold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-slate-900 animate-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 100ms">
        <span class="block whitespace-nowrap">Merkür Eğitim Akademisi'ne</span>
        <span class="relative text-brand-600 inline-block mt-2">
          <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 418 42" class="absolute top-2/3 left-0 h-[0.58em] w-full fill-brand-200/70" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M203.371.916c-26.013-2.078-76.686 1.963-124.73 9.946L67.3 12.749C35.421 18.062 18.2 21.766 6.004 25.934 1.244 27.561.828 27.778.874 28.61c.07 1.214.828 1.121 9.595-1.176 9.072-2.377 17.15-3.92 39.246-7.496C123.565 7.986 157.869 4.492 195.942 5.046c7.461.108 19.25 1.696 19.17 2.582-.107 1.183-7.874 4.31-25.75 10.366-21.992 7.45-35.43 12.534-36.701 13.884-2.173 2.308-.202 4.407 4.442 4.734 2.654.187 3.263.157 15.593-.78 35.401-2.686 57.944-3.488 88.365-3.143 46.327.526 75.721 2.23 130.788 7.584 19.787 1.924 20.814 1.98 24.557 1.332l.066-.011c1.201-.203 1.53-1.825.399-2.335-2.911-1.31-4.893-1.604-22.048-3.261-57.509-5.556-87.871-7.36-132.059-7.842-23.239-.254-33.617-.116-50.627.674-11.629.54-42.371 2.494-46.696 2.967-2.359.259 8.133-3.625 26.504-9.81 23.239-7.825 27.934-10.149 28.304-14.005.417-4.348-3.529-6-16.878-7.066Z"></path></svg>
          <span class="relative">hoş geldiniz.</span>
        </span>
      </h1>

      <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed animate-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 200ms">
        <p>Her öğrencinin içinde keşfedilmeyi bekleyen bir potansiyel vardır; biz o potansiyeli gerçeğe dönüştürmek için buradayız.</p>
        <p>Doğru rehberlik, doğru yöntem ve güçlü bir sistemle başarı artık bir sonuç değil, bir süreçtir.</p>
        <p>Bu yüzden öğrencilerimizi sadece bugünün sınavlarına değil; geleceğin güçlü dünyasına hazırlıyoruz.</p>
        <p class="font-display font-semibold text-xl text-brand-600">"Merkür'e gelin; dünyanız değişsin!"</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 sm:mt-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3 sm:gap-4 animate-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 300ms">
        <a href="#basvuru" class="group relative inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-brand-600 px-6 sm:px-8 py-3.5 sm:py-4 text-sm sm:text-[15px] font-semibold text-white transition-all hover:bg-brand-700 hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(59,169,214,0.35)] hover:-translate-y-0.5">
          <span>Ücretsiz Ön Görüşme</span>
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a href={`https://wa.me/${SITE.whatsappNumber}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="group inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full border-2 border-slate-200/80 bg-white px-6 sm:px-8 py-3 sm:py-3.5 text-sm sm:text-[15px] font-semibold text-slate-700 transition-all hover:border-emerald-500 hover:text-emerald-600 hover:shadow-soft hover:-translate-y-0.5">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" width="22" height="22" fill="currentColor"><path d="M19.11 17.32c-.27-.13-1.6-.79-1.85-.88-.25-.09-.43-.13-.6.13-.18.27-.7.88-.86 1.06-.16.18-.32.2-.59.07-.27-.13-1.13-.42-2.16-1.33-.8-.71-1.34-1.59-1.5-1.86-.16-.27-.02-.41.12-.54.13-.13.27-.32.4-.49.13-.16.18-.27.27-.45.09-.18.04-.34-.02-.47-.07-.13-.6-1.45-.83-1.99-.22-.52-.44-.45-.6-.46h-.51c-.18 0-.47.07-.72.34-.25.27-.94.92-.94 2.25 0 1.32.97 2.6 1.1 2.78.13.18 1.91 2.92 4.63 4.09.65.28 1.16.45 1.55.58.65.21 1.24.18 1.71.11.52-.08 1.6-.65 1.83-1.28.23-.62.23-1.16.16-1.28-.07-.13-.25-.2-.52-.34zM16.04 5.33c-5.86 0-10.62 4.76-10.62 10.62 0 1.87.49 3.7 1.42 5.31L5.33 27l5.86-1.53a10.6 10.6 0 0 0 4.85 1.16c5.86 0 10.62-4.76 10.62-10.62S21.9 5.33 16.04 5.33z"/></svg>
          WhatsApp'tan Yazın
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Trust indicators -->
      <div class="mt-12 flex items-center gap-5 border-t border-slate-200/60 pt-6 animate-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 400ms">
        <div class="flex -space-x-3">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?w=100&h=100&fit=crop" alt="Öğrenci" class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full border-2 border-white shadow-sm object-cover" />
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506869640319-fe1a24fd76dc?w=100&h=100&fit=crop" alt="Öğrenci" class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full border-2 border-white shadow-sm object-cover" />
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517486808906-6ca8b3f04846?w=100&h=100&fit=crop" alt="Öğrenci" class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full border-2 border-white shadow-sm object-cover" />
          <div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-full border-2 border-white shadow-sm bg-brand-50 flex items-center justify-center text-[11px] font-bold text-brand-700">500+</div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-sm text-slate-600">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-0.5 text-accent-400 mb-1">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900">%98</span> Veli & Öğrenci Memnuniyeti
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right: Visual -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-6 relative w-full max-w-[620px] ml-auto animate-fade-up mt-8 lg:mt-0" style="animation-delay: 250ms">
      <!-- Decorative Math Elements -->
      <span class="absolute -top-6 -left-4 sm:-left-10 text-brand-500/20 font-display text-2xl sm:text-4xl rotate-[-12deg] animate-float-slow select-none z-0">A = πr²</span>
      <span class="absolute -bottom-8 -right-2 sm:-right-6 text-accent-500/25 font-display text-xl sm:text-3xl rotate-[8deg] animate-float-slow select-none z-0" style="animation-delay: 1.5s">y−y₁ = m(x−x₁)</span>
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-brand-500 to-brand-300 rounded-[2rem] sm:rounded-[2.5rem] rotate-3 scale-[1.03] opacity-15"></div>
      
      <!-- Main Image Container -->
      <div class="relative rounded-[2rem] sm:rounded-[2.5rem] border-[4px] sm:border-[6px] border-white/80 bg-white shadow-2xl overflow-hidden aspect-[16/10] group z-10">
        <img 
          src="/image1.png" 
          alt="Merkür Eğitim Akademisi - Sınıf Ortamı" 
          class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 group-hover:scale-105"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/70 via-slate-900/10 to-transparent mix-blend-multiply"></div>
        
        <!-- Floating Logo Badge -->
        <div class="absolute top-4 right-4 sm:top-6 sm:right-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-md p-2.5 sm:p-3.5 shadow-xl border border-white/50 animate-float-slow" style="animation-delay: 0.5s">
          <img src="/icon.svg" alt="Merkür Akademi Logo" class="w-10 h-10 sm:w-12 sm:h-12 object-contain drop-shadow-sm" />
        </div>

        <!-- Floating Info Card -->
        <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 sm:bottom-6 sm:left-6 sm:right-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-md p-4 sm:p-5 shadow-xl border border-white/50 transform transition-all duration-300 group-hover:-translate-y-1">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 sm:gap-4">
            <div class="flex h-10 w-10 sm:h-12 sm:w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-500 to-brand-700 text-white shadow-soft">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="sm:w-6 sm:h-6"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="font-display font-bold text-slate-900 text-base sm:text-lg leading-tight mb-0.5">10+ Yıl Deneyim</div>
              <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 leading-tight">Alanında uzman rehberlik</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
